Regarding the functional mobility variables, a main time effect was observed for all, while no time by training interaction was found. Post hoc tests revealed improvements after the intervention period (from T 2 to T 3 ) for MaxWS ( t = −2.97, P = 0.05) and BoxWS ( t = −2.87, P = 0.006), while TalkWS did not change from T 2 to T 3 , but changed from T 1 to T 2 ( Table 3 ).

